an style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Local):<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/08 (15h-18h30))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">1 Milha Estafetas<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 15 Ago \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 20:30<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00f5es Online:<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 10\/08)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">\u00daltima Hora (Local):<\/strong> A confirmar<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (15\/08 (15h-18h30))<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 15 de Agosto de 2026, com partidas marcadas para as 20:30 no Parque das Amendoeiras.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova tem lugar no Parque das Amendoeiras, no concelho de S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel e distrito de Faro (Algarve), acolhendo a partida e a meta no mesmo local.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o formato oficial da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O programa contempla a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de 1 Milha (1,6 km), cumprida em 4 voltas a um circuito fechado de 402 metros, existindo participa\u00e7\u00e3o individual e por equipas de estafeta.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como funciona o consumo de cerveja e a op\u00e7\u00e3o sem \u00e1lcool?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Na prova individual, o atleta bebe uma cerveja de 33 cl antes de iniciar cada uma das 4 voltas. Nas estafetas, cada elemento bebe antes do seu percurso. \u00c9 permitida cerveja sem \u00e1lcool, por\u00e9m esta op\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o conta para a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial nem para trof\u00e9us.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso consultar as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online at\u00e9 10 de agosto e no secretariado no dia do evento (15h00 \u00e0s 18h30). As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e resultados podem ser consultados no portal Portugal Running ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o da prova.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-08-15\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Parque das Amendoeiras\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel\", \"addressRegion\": \"Faro\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Free Challenge Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Desportiva e S\u00f3cio-Cultural\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 15 de Agosto de 2026, com partidas marcadas para as 20:30 no Parque das Amendoeiras.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde se realiza a prova e qual \u00e9 o concelho e distrito?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova tem lugar no Parque das Amendoeiras, no concelho de S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel e distrito de Faro (Algarve), acolhendo a partida e a meta no mesmo local.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias e o formato oficial da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O programa contempla a dist\u00e2ncia oficial de 1 Milha (1,6 km), cumprida em 4 voltas a um circuito fechado de 402 metros, existindo participa\u00e7\u00e3o individual e por equipas de estafeta.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como funciona o consumo de cerveja e a op\u00e7\u00e3o sem \u00e1lcool?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Na prova individual, o atleta bebe uma cerveja de 33 cl antes de iniciar cada uma das 4 voltas. Nas estafetas, cada elemento bebe antes do seu percurso. \u00c9 permitida cerveja sem \u00e1lcool, por\u00e9m esta op\u00e7\u00e3o n\u00e3o conta para a classifica\u00e7\u00e3o oficial nem para trof\u00e9us.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso consultar as inscri\u00e7\u00f5es e as classifica\u00e7\u00f5es da Beer Run S\u00e3o Br\u00e1s de Alportel?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online at\u00e9 10 de agosto e no secretariado no dia do evento (15h00 \u00e0s 18h30). As classifica\u00e7\u00f5es oficiais e resultados podem ser consultados no portal Portugal Running ap\u00f3s a conclus\u00e3o da prova.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":54296,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478],"event_type_2":[728,149,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-54295","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-sao-bras-de-alportel-faro","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type_2-algarve-e-sul","event_type_2-faro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/07\/6a58dc9d698b5_Cartaz-cartaz_460.jpg","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/54295","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":